From b43d3fb9423dc36a67127fda3b7a9178908a12cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Willian Z <willian@willian.email>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:23:19 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Allow ZedLink to expose SSH project folders

Roots written as ssh://host/absolute/path match only a folder of a project connected to that SSH host, and local roots now match only local projects. Remote roots have no files on this machine, so project files, search and Git return UNSUPPORTED_CAPABILITY for them; threads, approvals, terminals and tasks work as for local roots.
